WELCOME TO LEGACY OS™
=====================

Thank you for purchasing the Legacy OS Bundle.

Legacy OS is a practical planning system designed to help Gen X women manage caregiving, financial autonomy, retirement readiness, and legacy planning with more confidence and less chaos.

WHAT'S INCLUDED
---------------

1. Legacy OS System (MAIN PRODUCT)

Open the HTML file in any modern web browser such as Chrome, Edge, or Firefox.

Inside you'll find three core sections:

PLAN
• Financial Autonomy Planner
• Freedom Number Calculator
• Retirement and Asset Planning Tools

PROTECT
• Caregiver's Survival Kit
• Care Cost Planning
• Benefits and Resource Tracking

OPERATE
• Legacy Command Center
• Appointment Management
• Delegation Tracking
• Budget Organization
• Family and Professional Communication Templates

QUICK START (10 MINUTES)
------------------------

1. Open the Legacy OS System HTML file in your browser.
2. Start with PLAN and calculate your Freedom Number.
3. Review your projected cash flow and financial goals.
4. Move to PROTECT and estimate your caregiving exposure and costs.
5. Move to OPERATE and enter your first appointments, tasks, or planning items.

PRIVACY
-------

All information remains stored locally in your browser.

• No account required
• No cloud storage
• No data collection
• No information is transmitted anywhere

To reset the system, simply clear your browser's local site data.

